  "title": "New Red Potato Salad",
  "description": "This simple chilled potato salad recipe makes great use of unpeeled new red potatoes, hard-cooked eggs, celery, and mayonnaise — perfect for a cookout.",
  "authors": [
    "DWAGNER"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T09:17:20-04:00",
